#. module: muk_mcp_skills
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_muk_mcp_skills
msgid ""
"\n"
"Implements the Skills extension of the Model Context Protocol on top\n"
"of the MuK MCP Server. Administrators write skills in Odoo: a name, a\n"
"line that tells the AI client when to use it, the instructions and\n"
"the files they refer to. Every MCP client that supports the extension\n"
"lists the skills the user of its key may use and loads one when a\n"
"request fits.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Implémente l'extension Skills du Model Context Protocol par-dessus MuK\n"
"MCP Server. Les administrateurs rédigent des skills dans Odoo : un nom,\n"
"une ligne qui indique au client IA quand l'utiliser, les instructions et\n"
"les fichiers auxquels elles renvoient. Tout client MCP compatible avec\n"
"l'extension liste les skills que l'utilisateur de sa clé peut employer et\n"
"en charge un lorsqu'une demande correspond.\n"

